This package includes a third-party 3D model.

assets/laptop.glb
-----------------
This work is based on "MacBook"
(https://sketchfab.com/3d-models/macbook-07f012fbd3bb4c37a1b9ed08533ee403)
by Nicholas-3D (https://sketchfab.com/Nicholas01)
licensed under CC-BY-4.0 (http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).

Changes made to the original:
  - converted from glTF + separate textures to a single binary .glb;
  - the model was levelled and centred, and a "LidPivot" empty was added on
    the hinge axis so the lid's opening angle is a single rotation;
  - the display rectangle and hinge position were measured and recorded in
    asset.extras;
  - the maker's mark was removed from the baseColor and metallicRoughness
    textures. The geometry is unchanged.

CC-BY-4.0 requires that this credit travels with the model. If you replace
assets/laptop.glb with your own model you may remove this file; if you keep
it, keep the credit — including in any build output that ships the model.

The MIT licence in LICENSE covers this package's own source code only. It
does not cover the model, which stays under CC-BY-4.0.

